          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu akamwambia Aroni, “Nenda jangwani ukakutane na Mose.” Basi, Aroni akaenda, akakutana na Mose kwenye mlima wa Mungu, akambusu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Mose akamwambia Aroni maneno yote aliyoambiwa na Mwenyezi-Mungu ayaseme, na miujiza yote aliyoagizwa atende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Mose na Aroni wakaenda, wakawakusanya wazee wote wa Waisraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aroni akawaambia maneno yote Mwenyezi-Mungu aliyokuwa amemwagiza Mose, na kuifanya ile miujiza mbele ya watu wote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu wakaamini. Na waliposikia kwamba Mwenyezi-Mungu amewajia kuwasaidia Waisraeli, na kwamba ameyaona mateso yao, wote wakainamisha vichwa vyao na kumwabudu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.31",
